# Home-page banners.
# Multipart requests read ./testfiles/sample.jpg - drop any image there
# (the testfiles/ folder is git-ignored).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3030
@accessToken = <access_token from auth.http>
@bannerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List banners (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/banners

### Get a banner (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/banners/{{bannerId}}

### Create a banner (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/banners
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="link"

https://example.com/collections/sofas
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="banner.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./testfiles/sample.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### Update a banner link (admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/banners/{{bannerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "link": "https://example.com/collections/beds"
}

### Delete a banner (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/banners/{{bannerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
